2311 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project focuses on developing a web scraper to analyze hotel prices and customer satisfaction on Booking.com. It covers five North African countries; Tunisia, Morocco, Algeria, Libya, and Mauritania and examines data across different seasons to identify pricing trends and satisfaction patterns. By using web scraping, the project aims to support better decision-making through customer feedback analysis, competition monitoring, and market insights. This will be done in 3 phases : web scraping, data cleaning and data visualization.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2168 0 R
>>
endobj
